{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>עפיה</b> — Yefet says: its branches [ענפיו], and similarly: מבין עפאים יתנו קול. He also interpreted וחזותיה עביו, and thus 'horn' for חזות. And some say: עפיה is upon it." "<b>ואנביה</b> — and its fruit." "<b>תטלל</b> — like the form of a shadow." "<b>ובענפוהי</b> — its branches." "<b>צפרי</b> — bird." "<b>יתזן</b> — from the root מזון."], :book :daniel, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {0 "The biblical quotations are given in Ibn Ezra's Hebrew; they are not his words but cited Aramaic/Hebrew forms whose script I preserve per discipline."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Daniel - Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/daniel"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:19:50.283372208Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}